{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-033.md","record_count":57,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"லீலா...லீலா...என்ன லீலா, பயந்துட்டியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இதெல்லாம்எனக்கு ஒண்ணும்பிடிக்கவே இல்லை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நாடகம்! நாடகம் நடத்துனீங்களே அது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! கலாட்டா வந்துடுச்சேன்னு கவலைப்படுறியா? இதெல்லாம் சகஜம் லீலா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்களுக்கு சகஜமா இருக்கலாம்: எனக்கு சங்கடமாயிருக்கு! கலாட்டாவுல ஒரு கல்லோ, கம்போ தலையில்பட்டிருந்தா என்னா ஆகிறது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன ஆயிருக்கும்? கொஞ்சம் ரத்தம் வந்திருக்கும்! அவ்வளவுதான் லீலா! இந்த ஒடம்பு எவ்வளவு தியாகத் தழும்புகளை ஏத்துகிட்டு இருக்கு தெரியுமா? இப்ப நம்ம நாடகத்திலே கலாட்டா நடக்குதேன்னு பாக்கிறியா? நான் இதுக்கெல்லாம் ஒண்ணும் பயப்படமாட்டேன்; இதெல்லாம், பல தியாகத் தழும்புகளை ஏற்றுக் கொள்ளத் தயாராகத்தான் இருக்கவேண்டும்! கல் விழும்; கம்பு போடுவான்; காட்டாறு குறுக்கிடும். இதுக்கெல்லாம் கலங்கக்கூடாது லீலா! காதல் பாதைன்னா சாமான்யமா என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன? என்ன? என்ன பாதை?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாதை...பாதை...கால் பாதை...ரோடு","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன ரோடு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரோடு...ஈரோடு! ஈரோடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா ஈரோடு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்ல லீலா! நீ ஈரத்தோட இருக்கிறியேன்னு சொல்லவந்தேன்! அது குளுவுருலே நாக்கு குழரி ஈரோடுன்னு வந்துடுச்சி! பரவாயில்ல...காஞ்சீ! காஞ்சீ...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன காஞ்சீ...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தலை காஞ்சிடுங்கிறேன்...ஈரத்தோட இருக்கியே, லீலா, ஜுரங் கிரம் வந்துடப்போவுது...நான் ஒரு பொடவை தர்ரேன் கட்டிக்கிறியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எங்கே இருக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒனக்கு வேணும்னா என் வயத்தை கிழிச்சில்ல எடுப்பேன்...இந்தா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒங்களுக்கு?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் ஒண்ணுதனே எடுத்துவச்சேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"லீலா...உம்...வா, வா! குளிரு அடிக்குதுல்ல?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒனக்கும் குளிரு அடிக்குதுலல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...மா...ம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்கும் குளிரு அடிக்குது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பயப்படாதே! பயப்படாதே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன இது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இது...அதான், இந்த இது...அடடே இந்த இதுல்ல இது வாயில இருக்கு வரமாட்டேங்குது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":47,"printed_page":46}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப துப்பிடுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது முடியாது! ஆம்...லவ்மீட்டர்! லவ்மீட்டர்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா மீட்டர்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதான், காதலை அளக்கும் கருவி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா கருவி?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! அதாவது மனசு களங்கம் உள்ளவங்க இதைத் தொட்டா ‘பக்கு’ன்னு கடிச்சிபுடும்! களங்கம் இல்லாதவங்க தொட்டா ஒண்ணும் பண்ணாது! ஆ!...ஒனக்கு ஒண்ணும் இல்லேன்னு நெனைக்கிறேன், களங்கம் இல்லேன்னு நெனைக்கிறேன்! நீ கையை வையி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...நான் மாட்டேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப ஒனக்கு களங்கம் இருக்கு! களங்கம் இருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்கொண்ணும் களங்கம் இல்லே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய், ஒண்ணுஞ் செய்யலே, அப்ப ஒனக்கு களங்கம் இல்லே. எனக்கு மட்டும் என்னவாம்? நானும் வைக்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"லீலா...லீலா...மீனைப் பாத்தியா மீனு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எங்கே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உன் கண்ணுல.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி...சரி...நிறுத்துங்க. ஒங்க போக்கு எனக்கு புரிஞ்சிடுச்சி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்...என் போக்கு புரிஞ்சிடுச்சா? ஆனா உன் போக்குதான் எனக்கு இன்னும் புரியலே. கொஞ்சம் புரிஞ்சி கிட்டு வருது ஆனா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒண்ணுமில்லை. அன்னைக்கு, நீ அந்த சேலை ஜாக்கெட்டு பாக்கெட்டை, என் காரிலேயே மறந்துட்டு...வச்சுட்டு...போயிட்டியா? நான் எடுத்துகிட்டு...ஒன்கிட்ட கொடுக்கிறதுக்கு வந்தனா? வந்தா திடீர்னு சமரசம் வீடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சமரசம் வீடா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம் அங்குள்ள அந்த நாயிகூட என்னை துரத்து துரத்துனுன் துரத்தி...வெரட்டு வெரட்டுன்னு வெரட்டி...நான் ஓடு ஓடுன்னு ஓடி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ, ஓடியாடி கடைசிலே நம்ப வீட்டுக்கு பக்கத்து வீடு சமரசம் வீட்டுக்குள்ள புகுந்துட்டீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d049","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா! அந்த பாக்கெட்டை அந்த அம்மா அறை\nயிலே போட்டுட்டு வந்துட்டேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47},{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"page_segments":[{"pdf_page":48,"printed_page":47,"text":"ஆமா! அந்த பாக்கெட்டை அந்த அம்மா அறை"},{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48,"text":"யிலே போட்டுட்டு வந்துட்டேன்!"}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d050","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா ஆமா! அந்த அம்மா ஏங்கிட்ட கொடுத்தாங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d051","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் கொடுத்ததா சொல்லி கொடுத்திருப்பாங்களே! நான் குடுத்ததா சொல்லி குடுத்திருப்பாங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d052","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா, சரி! போகலாம். குளிரும் கொஞ்சம் குறைஞ்சிருப்பதாகத் தெரிகிறது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d053","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம். குளிரு குறையத்தான் செய்யும். ஏன்னா வார்த்தையிலே சூடேறுதுல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d054","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ம், போகலாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d055","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இரு லீலா...கொஞ்சம் பேசிட்டு போகலாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d056","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா பாருங்க. இதெல்லாம் நல்லாயில்லே. நீங்க இப்படி எல்லாம் நடந்துகிட்டா அப்புறம் நான் வேலைக்குக் கூட வரமுடியாது. ஆமாம், எங்கவிட்ல அனுப்பமாட்டாங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s033-d057","scene_id":"raja-rani-s033","scene_ordinal":33,"transition_audit_id":"T033","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ. வேலைக்கு வரமாட்டியா? உங்க வீட்ல அனுப்ப மாட்டாங்களா? அப்ப இன்னைக்கு இதுவரைக்கும் போதும்...போகலாம். மெள்ள, மெள்ள. பாத்து, பாத்து.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-033.md"}]}